        "jp_sha256": "26ef4b690a63fe01cf3271002b834daa82d0b2575f29a83c12a038ffa9b50fbc",
        "official_en_sha256": "9fcbafc5a6f911f4d74c87e1fae71a794bb5284f03b704690c6ac9bd0ed03a9b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ビジョンのMRが上がり獲得したアビリティは\r\nアビリティ装備をすることで効果を発揮します。\r\n\r\nただしアビリティには装備コストが存在し\r\n総コスト内に収まるよう装備する必要があります。\r\n総コストはビジョンのMRを上げていくことで上昇していきます。",
        "official_en": "Abilities gained from increasing a vision’s MR must\r\nbe equipped in order to use them.\r\n\r\nNote that each ability has a cost, limiting the total\r\nnumber of abilities you can equip. Increasing a\r\nvision’s MR will earn you more AP, allowing you\r\nto equip more abilities.",
        "real_en": "Abilities gained by raising a vision’s MR only take effect once equipped.\r\n\r\nEach ability has an equipment cost, so the total cost of equipped abilities must stay within your limit.\r\nRaising a vision’s MR increases that total cost limit."
      },
